00:05:32.550 --> 00:05:38.100
have to handle this
quick increase in load

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:41.520
and continue to serve the great
experience that it did even

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:43.140
when the load was
one fifth of what

00:05:43.140 --> 00:05:46.800
