00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:49.980
And that is a challenge.

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:53.000
So one thing that most
retailers have seen

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:54.770
is, hey, the Cloud can help you.

00:05:54.770 --> 00:05:58.225
Google Cloud is very
well-suited for handling

00:05:58.225 --> 00:05:59.100
