That was pretty amazing
to hear about your journey

00:39:46.520 --> 00:39:49.820
and your plans.

00:39:49.820 --> 00:39:50.340
All right.

00:39:50.340 --> 00:39:53.230
So one of the things that--

00:39:53.230 --> 00:39:55.590
first of all, thank
you, Jimit and Fatala,

00:39:55.590 --> 00:39:58.770
for sharing your
stories with us.

00:39:58.770 --> 00:40:02.130
It's amazing to see
how the different paths

00:40:02.130 --> 00:40:05.700
and the different
ways that retailers

00:40:05.700 --> 00:40:10.260
can use to move their existing
applications onto the Cloud.

00:40:10.260 --> 00:40:12.570
And essentially,
all we are looking

00:40:12.570 --> 00:40:15.240
